ion/problem "Given the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 0 \\\\ -3 & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}]$, find the result of applying to $A$ the following elementary row operations: \n\n$$\n{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+\\frac{3}{1+\\text{i}}{R}_{1}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's apply the row operations to $A:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 0 \\\\ -3 & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+\\frac{3}{1+\\text{i}}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 0 \\\\ -3+\\frac{3}{1+\\text{i}}\\cdot (1+\\text{i}) & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the result  is \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-76252/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ef2e7753-83f4-5826-a04f-89616d34c578"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-76252"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-39014"] :question/problem "Given the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}2\\text{i}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2\\text{i} & 1\\end{aligned}]$, find the result of applying to $A$ the following  elementary row operations:\n\n$$\n{R}_{1}=\\frac{1}{2\\text{i}-1}{R}_{1},\\,{R}_{2}={R}_{2}-2\\text{i}{R}_{1}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's apply the row operations to $A:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\text{i}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2\\text{i} & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{2\\text{i}-1}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 2\\text{i} & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-2\\text{i}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the result is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-39005/selection/1f771427d2633c47aff17eafc1